                      (../../defs/coco.d):00063         *
     0001             (../../defs/coco.d):00064         OneMHz              EQU       1
     0002             (../../defs/coco.d):00065         TwoMHz              EQU       2
                      (../../defs/coco.d):00066                             IFEQ      CPUType-Color
