     003C             (../../defs/coco.d):00077         Hz60                EQU       60                  Assemble clock for 60 hz power
                      (../../defs/coco.d):00078                             IFNDEF    PwrLnFrq
     003C             (../../defs/coco.d):00079         PwrLnFrq            SET       Hz60                Set to Appropriate freq
                      (../../defs/coco.d):00080                             ENDC
                      (../../defs/coco.d):00081         
                      (../../defs/coco.d):00082         
                      (../../defs/coco.d):00083         **********************************
