                      (../../defs/coco.d):00131         * VDG Devices
                      (../../defs/coco.d):00132         *
     FFC0             (../../defs/coco.d):00133         A.TermV             SET       $FFC0               VDG Term
     FFC1             (../../defs/coco.d):00134         A.V1                SET       $FFC1               Possible additional VDG Devices
     FFC2             (../../defs/coco.d):00135         A.V2                SET       $FFC2
     FFC3             (../../defs/coco.d):00136         A.V3                SET       $FFC3
     FFC4             (../../defs/coco.d):00137         A.V4                SET       $FFC4
     FFC5             (../../defs/coco.d):00138         A.V5                SET       $FFC5
     FFC6             (../../defs/coco.d):00139         A.V6                SET       $FFC6
